000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. ERRPGM.
000300 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000400 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
000500 FILE-CONTROL.
000600     SELECT CLAIM-FILE ASSIGN TO UT-S-CLMFILE.
000700 DATA DIVISION.
000800 FILE SECTION.
000900 FD  CLAIM-FILE.
001000 01  CLAIM-REC              PIC X(100).
001100 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
001200     EXEC SQL INCLUDE POLDCL END-EXEC.
001300 01  WS-CALL-FLAG           PIC X VALUE 'N'.
001400 01  WS-ERR-CD              PIC X(04) VALUE 'E999'.
001500     88  WS-ERR-NONE        VALUE 'E000'.
001600     88  WS-ERR-FATAL       VALUE 'E900' THRU 'E999'.
001700 01  WS-AMT                 PIC S9(7)V99 COMP-3.
